cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "polydrift"
abstract: >-
  Read-only measurement harness for Polymarket and Kalshi. It records prices over time
  to answer one question: does a forecast that diverges from the market price predict
  subsequent convergence, net of fees? It never trades and holds no keys.
